"""Editorial questions for generative art, AI music, and AI voice."""

from review_angle_plans import audit, revise_domain


GENERATIVE_ART = """history_origins|Generative Art Before Current AI|Which rule-based or computational practice shaped a later work?|Use dated artwork, code, artist statements, and context.
famous_examples|A Celebrated Generated Image Revisited|Which creative choices did people make and which were automated?|Trace prompts, selection, edits, model, and display.
hidden_stories|Labor Behind a Generated Image|Who supplied source work, labels, software, and curatorial decisions?|Credit documented contributors and rights holders.
beginner_explainers|From Brief to Image|How do a model and artist produce a finished visual work?|Explain input, generation, selection, editing, and output.
advanced_concepts|Control Over Expressive Elements|How does an artist shape composition beyond an initial prompt?|Compare iterations, edits, and final decisions.
mysteries_unsolved_cases|An Image's Unclear Provenance|Which records show how a generated image was made?|Check files, metadata, project notes, and gaps.
technology_innovation|A New Visual Generation Tool|What task became possible or easier for a creator?|Compare quality, control, accessibility, and cost.
people_personalities|An Artist's Process|How does a named creator describe and document their choices?|Use interviews, drafts, and work records.
major_events|A Generative-Art Exhibition|How were works selected, labeled, and received?|Read dated catalog, wall text, and audience response.
how_it_works|Image Model in an Art Workflow|How do source inputs, generation, human selection, and finishing connect?|Trace one consented project.
rise_fall|A Generative Art Trend Reassessed|What changed in tools, institutions, and artist practice?|Compare works and records across a defined period.
then_vs_now|One Visual Brief Across Tools|How did control, output, and labor change?|Use matched brief and transparent workflow.
future_developments|A Proposed Creative Tool|What would make it useful and fair to working artists?|Test rights, control, costs, and accessibility.
myths_vs_facts|One Prompt Equals Full Authorship?|Which expressive decisions occurred before and after generation?|Document actual workflow and jurisdiction-specific rules.
documentary_stories|Making One Generative Work|What happened from idea to exhibition or publication?|Follow drafts, collaborators, rights, and audience.
creative_brief|A Visual Problem for a Creator|What was the intended message, audience, and constraint?|Read brief and compare finished work.
materials_and_tools|Models as Art Materials|Which model, dataset, editing tools, and physical media were used?|Document versions, sources, and permissions.
process_breakdown|Iterations to Final Image|Which candidates were rejected and why?|Examine consented process records and edits.
composition_choice|Composition Under Human Control|How were framing, color, texture, and emphasis chosen?|Compare generated variants and final decisions.
collaborative_authorship|Many Hands in One Image|How should contributors and source creators be credited?|Trace agreements and actual creative roles.
adaptation_across_media|Image into Print or Installation|What changes when a generated file becomes a physical work?|Check material, scale, display, and rights.
audience_reception|How Viewers Read the Work|Does disclosure affect interpretation?|Use attributed reviews and audience study.
cultural_context|Style and Cultural References|Which traditions does a generated work draw on?|Attribute sources and ask affected makers.
preservation_restoration|Preserving a Generative Work|What must be saved to recreate or study it?|Record model version, seeds, files, edits, and display.
rights_and_attribution|Who May Use the Output?|Which rights and licenses cover inputs, contributors, and display?|Name jurisdiction and documents, avoid universal legal claims.
style_comparison|Two Images, Different Methods|What visual differences follow from distinct workflows?|Compare composition and documented process, not style labels alone.
creative_failure|When an Image Misses the Brief|What did a failed iteration teach the artist?|Use drafts and creator account.
field_visual_composition|Visual Structure of a Generated Work|How do space, color, and focal points guide attention?|Analyze an attributed finished work.
field_material_provenance|Provenance of Digital and Physical Inputs|Which files, source works, and print materials have traceable origins?|Check creator records and supplier claims.
field_maker_technique|Artist Technique with a Model|Which prompts, edits, coding, or fabrication are intentional?|Document a named creator's method.
field_conservation_problem|A Work Dependent on Software|What fails when model, format, or display becomes obsolete?|Test preservation options and rights.
field_audience_context|Work in Its Display Setting|How does venue, label, and audience shape meaning?|Study one exhibition or release.
"""

